@startuml module_structure
title MicroLA Module Structure & Dependencies

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Core Headers (include/microla/)" {

    [compiler_features.hpp] as compiler #E6F3FF
    note right of compiler
        **Feature Detection Macros:**
        MICROLA_CONSTEXPR20/23/26
        MICROLA_CONSTEVAL, MICROLA_IF_CONSTEVAL
        MICROLA_UNREACHABLE, MICROLA_CONSTEXPR_TRIG
        MICROLA_ASSUME, MICROLA_FORCEINLINE, MICROLA_BIT_CAST

        **Minimal dependencies**
        Mostly preprocessor macros +
        compile-time config validation
    end note

    [constants.hpp] as constants #FFE6F0
    note right of constants
        **Mathematical Constants:**
        pi, two_pi, deg_to_rad, rad_to_deg
        e, golden_ratio, sqrt2, sqrt3
        epsilon (float/double/generic)

        **C++20+ variable templates**
        **Callable constant proxies**

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
    end note

    [vector.hpp] as vector #F0FFE6
    note right of vector
        **Vec<T, N> Class:**
        • N-dimensional vectors
        • Arithmetic operators
        • dot/cross products
        • Normalization, lerp
        • SIMD: NEON/CMSIS/RISC-V/AVX

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
                constants.hpp
                simd_helpers.hpp
    end note

    [matrix.hpp] as matrix #FFFACD
    note right of matrix
        **Mat<T, R, C> Class:**
        • R×C matrices (row-major)
        • Arithmetic operators
        • transpose, trace, determinant
        • inverse, block operations
        • Rotation matrices
        • SIMD: NEON/CMSIS/RISC-V/AVX optimized

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
                constants.hpp
                vector.hpp (for cross)
                simd_helpers.hpp
    end note

    [quaternion.hpp] as quaternion #FFE6E6
    note right of quaternion
        **Quaternion<T> Class:**
        • 3D rotation representation
        • SLERP interpolation
        • Matrix conversion
        • Euler angles
        • Full NEON/CMSIS/RISC-V support

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
                constants.hpp
                vector.hpp
                matrix.hpp
    end note

    [geometry.hpp] as geometry #F0E6FF
    note right of geometry
        **Geometric Primitives:**
        • Ray<T>, Plane<T>
        • AABB<T>, Sphere<T>
        • Triangle<T>, Frustum<T>
        • Intersection tests
        • Uses std::optional (C++17)

        Depends: vector.hpp, matrix.hpp
    end note

    [kalman.hpp] as kalman #E6FFF0
    note right of kalman
        **KalmanFilter<T, STATE_DIM, MEAS_DIM>:**
        • Standard Kalman filter
        • Joseph form covariance update
        • Innovation & NIS computation
        • Control input support
        • Template defaults to float

        Depends: vector.hpp, matrix.hpp
    end note

    [extended_kalman.hpp] as ekf #F0FFE6
    note right of ekf
        **ExtendedKalmanFilter<T, STATE_DIM, MEAS_DIM>:**
        • Nonlinear system support
        • Jacobian linearization
        • User-provided models
        • Joseph/simplified updates
        • Template defaults to float

        Depends: vector.hpp, matrix.hpp
    end note

    [safe_math.hpp] as safe_math #FFE6D0
    note right of safe_math
        **Safety-Critical Operations:**
        • safe_divide (div-by-zero check)
        • saturating_add/sub/mul
        • safe_sqrt, safe_acos, safe_asin
        • is_finite, is_nan checks
        • All default to float

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
    end note

    [fast_math.hpp] as fast_math #D0FFFF
    note right of fast_math
        **Fast Approximations (fast::):**
        • sin/cos (Bhaskara I, ~0.17% error)
        • rsqrt (Quake III, 2-3× faster)
        • exp/ln/pow (polynomial, 2-5× faster)
        • lerp, smoothstep
        • All default to float

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
    end note

    [numerical_stability.hpp] as numerical #FFD0FF
    note right of numerical
        **Numerical Stability:**
        • kahan_sum<T, Iterator>(begin, end)
        • hypot/hypot3 (stable magnitude)
        • approx_equal (relative + absolute tolerance)
        • log1p_safe, expm1_safe
        • stable_dot_product (Kahan-compensated)
        • condition_number_2x2, precision_loss_bits
        • ulp_distance, horner_eval

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp,
                high_precision.hpp
    end note

    [resource_checks.hpp] as resource #FFE6B3
    note right of resource
        **Compile-Time Checks:**
        • VecLayoutCheck<T, N>
        • MatSizeInfo<T, R, C>
        • QuaternionSizeInfo<T>
        • POD/contiguity verification
        • DMA compatibility

        Depends: vector.hpp, matrix.hpp,
                quaternion.hpp
    end note

    [simd_helpers.hpp] as simd_helpers #FFD0D0
    note right of simd_helpers
        **SIMD Helper Functions:**
        • Portable SIMD wrappers
        • NEON/CMSIS/AVX/RISC-V abstractions
        • Float-only optimizations
        • Used by vector/matrix/quaternion

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
    end note

    [high_precision.hpp] as high_precision #D0D0FF
    note right of high_precision
        **High Precision Intermediate:**
        • hi_t<T> type selection
        • Embedded-aware long-double fallback
        • Used for intermediate computations

        Depends: compiler_features.hpp
    end note

    [sensor_fusion.hpp] as sensor_fusion #E6FFD0
    note right of sensor_fusion
        **Sensor Fusion:**
        • OrientationEstimator (Mahony/MEKF)
        • RelativeAngleEstimator
        • 9-DOF/6-DOF fusion
        • SI-unit agnostic calibration

        Depends: vector.hpp, matrix.hpp,
                quaternion.hpp, extended_kalman.hpp
    end note

    [vector_view.hpp] as vector_view #FFE6E6
    note right of vector_view
        **Vector Views:**
        • Non-owning vector slices
        • Stride support
        • Subvector references

        Depends: vector.hpp
    end note

    [matrix_view.hpp] as matrix_view #E6FFD0
    note right of matview
        **Matrix Views:**
        • Non-owning matrix slices
        • Block operations
        • Submatrix references

        Depends: matrix.hpp
    end note

    [version.hpp] as version #E6E6FF
    note right of version
        **Version Information:**
        MICROLA_VERSION_MAJOR/MINOR/PATCH
        get_version_string()
        get_version_number()
        version_at_least(major, minor, patch)

        **No dependencies**
    end note

    [microla.hpp] as main #D0D0FF
    note right of main
        **Main Include Header:**
        • Includes all components
        • Utility functions
        • Angle wrapping
        • memory_info namespace
        • C++20 concepts (optional)

        **Single-include convenience**
    end note
}

